- Story & Context: Decades after the troupe dissolved into the misty ravines of Mount Jirisan, park rangers discovered an abandoned food stall where five earthenware bowls of festive glass noodles were left steaming on cold burners moments after the 2024 totality ended. A trail of dried persimmon seeds and unspooled VHS tape led deep into the pine forest, where hikers recorded an unexplained sub-bass vibration shaking the pine needles alongside an angelic, multi-tracked idol chorus. A lone ranger approached the whistling soup pots and swore he heard the voice of a vanished vocalist laughing through the tin exhaust pipe: "Wash your bowls before the black sky wipes the table clean."
